This repository is a hard fork of duckdb/duckdb-node-neo. The upstream MIT
LICENSE is preserved verbatim. Modifications introduced by Haybarn:

  - npm package scope renamed from @duckdb/* to @haybarn/* across all 10
    publishable packages (api + dispatcher + 8 per-platform bindings).
  - Build-time engine fetch redirected from duckdb/duckdb GitHub Releases
    (libduckdb-*.zip) to Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn GitHub Releases
    (libhaybarn-*.zip). The native addon is named haybarn.node.
  - The native-addon link flag is -lhaybarn; the inside-zip library files
    are libhaybarn.so / libhaybarn.dylib / haybarn.dll / haybarn.lib.
  - The public C API header (duckdb.h) is preserved verbatim — that is the
    upstream C surface, and Haybarn is intentionally ABI-compatible with it.

Source for the underlying DuckDB engine, as modified by Haybarn, is at:
https://github.com/Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn

The original duckdb-node-neo project lives at:
https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-node-neo
